      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah, no XORKeyStream implementation can be constant-time relative to the order of calls, but what this is saying is that if you set the counter to 0xffffffff the next XORKeyStream call will take a different time than if you set it to a lower value, because we use a different implementation.\n\nI agree it\u0027s not super clear but I don\u0027t know how else to word it, and accept suggestions.",
